  "content": "\n\n<p>「Blue Archive」專為「Minecraft」設計的遊戲字體（建議安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modern-ui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">modern UI</a> 以消除像素化外觀）。與原版遊戲對比：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a48bc0d0-552c-41db-96e5-2b625739d822.png\" alt=\"遊戲畫面\" width=\"177\" height=\"104\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3a3dceba-515e-43a9-bc7b-6f2ab6d5719c.png\" alt=\"Blue Archive\" width=\"180\" height=\"122\"></p>\n<p>安裝 modern UI 後（效果完全相同！）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_89cd12b0-4ac0-4734-a1c3-14fb95778dcf.png\" alt=\"modern UI\" width=\"162\" height=\"53\"></p>",
